    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's exactly that. it's like the weight is just too much. sometimes i just find myself staring at the wall, thinking about what it would actually be like to just... stop. not just stopping work, but just everything stopping. the silence sounds so much better than the noise. it almost sounds like the only real way to get some actual peace.",
